    "zh": "在 33 回合内用脉冲让四台对手机器人停机，芽芽要留在场上。蓝包裹在第 3 回合末滑到西侧装货台，红包裹在第 7 回合末滑到旁边。中间的隔板同时打开，两侧各有一台追击机。",
    "en": "Tag out all 4 robots with pulses within 33 turns and keep Sprout running. The blue parcel slides to the west loading bay after turn 3 and the red parcel arrives beside it after turn 7. The central partition opens at the second delivery. A hunter starts on each outer belt."
